  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "深度學習應用與實作",
    "sub_ename": "DEEP LEARNING APPLICATIONS AND IMPLEMENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將教授學生深度學習的實務應用，培育理論與實務並重的人才。課程描述如下：\n1. 深度學習概念與架構：介紹深度學習的理論與學習架構，包括神經網路、卷積神經網路、循環神經網路、生成對抗網路等。\n2. Python程式基礎： Python的基本語法介紹、數據結構、函數、與模塊等。\n3. 深度學習框架：建置深度學習框架，並使用構建、訓練、與部署深度學習模型。\n4. AI實作專案：參與實作專案，解決實務問題如深偽判斷、AI生成式模型、自然語言處理、即時物件偵測、生成對抗學習等。",
    "describe_eh": "The course 'Deep Learning Applications and Python Implementation' will teach students the practical application of deep learning, cultivating talents who are proficient in both theory and practice. The course description is as follows:\n1. Introduction to Deep Learning Concepts: Introducing the theory and learning structures of deep learning, including neural networks, convolutional neural networks, recurrent neural networks, generative adversarial networks, etc.\n2. Python Programming Basics: Introduction to basic Python syntax, data structures, functions, and modules.\n3. Deep Learning Frameworks: Building deep learning frameworks and using them to construct, train, and deploy deep learning models.\n4. AI Implementation Projects: Participating in implementation projects to solve practical problems such as deepfake detection, AI generative models, natural language processing, real-time object detection, generative adversarial learning, etc.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學習多種深度學習網路的架構、工作原理、及最佳化學習法則",
      "describe_en": "Developing expertise in various deep learning network architectures, their working principles, and optimization techniques"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "應用Python於深度學習框架的實務設計",
      "describe_en": "Practical design of deep learning frameworks using Python"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "應用深度學習模型，解決AI領域的問題",
      "describe_en": "Application of deep learning models to address specific AI domain problems"
    }
